  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.57 - Full analyzer+fixer audit hardening\n\n            Changed:\n            - Shared AM003/AM021 collection-container incompatibility predicate so immutable/frozen/SortedSet/LinkedList container mismatches no longer double-report.\n            - AM020 fixer uses shared public+internal property discovery (no silent no-op on internal nested maps).\n            - AM021 list simple conversions gate Parse destinations to string sources; AM041 parenthesized ReverseMap registration; AM011 reverse per-property fuzzy; AM031 multi-collection multi-enum reports; catalog trust honesty (AM020 LikelyRewrite, AM022 Scaffold).\n            - Docs: AM001 Parse vs TryParse, AM022 MaxDepth(2), AM006 aggregate UX, AM050 sibling withhold, remove fake AM031.00x IDs.\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (1367 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - Analyzer and test projects build clean under -warnaserror (the release gate)\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.56 - Analyzer hitlist hardening",
